      "message": "fix(post): a cache judged under the old rapid law reads stale\n\nThe op stamp salt moves from v2 to v3. #2121 changed the rapid law, but\nthe post gate reads only the verdicts that a cache carries. A cache from\nthe old law matched its stamp and posted a traverse through uncut stock\nwith no warning. Now each old cache reads Stale, and the post refuses it\nby name until the user regenerates it.\n\n- Pin: tests/stale_rapid_law.rs over a recorded project with an old-law\n  cache (salt v2, no verdict on the traverse at Z 8 in a Z 10 stock).\n- examples/first-router-part.camproj carries its v3 stamps (each op\n  regenerated to the same path, no warnings).\n- wire_stamp's ONE_PROFILE_STAMP is re-pinned for the new salt.\n\nFixes #2152\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
